@Fenneka.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5126

### Pobierz wszystkich uczniów

GET {{Fenneka.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students
Accept: application/json

### Pobierz ucznia o ID 1

GET {{Fenneka.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/1
Accept: application/json

### Dodaj nowego ucznia

POST {{Fenneka.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Anna",
    "email": "anna_wolak80@interia.pl"
}
